'''Becoming Me''' is the opening theme song for the English [[dub]] of the first [[season]] of ''[[Pokémon Horizons: The Series]]'', also named {{OBP|Pokémon Horizons: The Series|season}}. It is the twenty-seventh English opening in the [[Pokémon animated series]] overall. The instrumental ending version first aired with ''[[HZ001|The Pendant That Starts It All (Part One)]]'', while the opening version was used from ''[[HZ002|The Pendant That Starts It All (Part Two)]]'' to ''[[HZ045|From So Far Away]]''.

The opening animation has two versions that are composed of clips from the different ''Pokémon Horizons: The Series'' Japanese openings, with the first version composed of clips from the first version of the first opening, [[Heart-Pounding Diary]], and the second version composed of clips from the second opening, [[Halo]]. The ending animation is composed of clips from the first ''Pokémon Horizons: The Series'' Japanese ending, [[RVR ~Rising Volt Tacklers Rap~]].

The full version of the song was released on [[iTunes Store|iTunes]], [[Google Play]], [[Prime Video|Amazon]], [[Spotify]], [[iTunes Store|Apple Music]], [[Prime Video|Amazon Music]], [[YouTube]], [[YouTube|YouTube Music]], and {{wp|Tidal (service)|Tidal}} on March 1, 2024.

In the Asian English and {{pmin|Indonesia}}n release of ''Pokémon Horizons: The Series'', Becoming Me is replaced as an opening theme by [[We Go|We Go (English Ver.)]], while the instrumental version of Becoming Me is retained as the ending theme. For the {{pmin|South Asia|Hindi, Tamil, Telugu and Bengali dubs}}, [[Let's Get Started]] and [[Boom Kaboom]] are used as the opening and ending themes respectively, using the same footage as Becoming Me.

