==Opening animation==
===Version 1 ([[HZ001]] - [[HZ025]])===
[[File:HZ OPE01.png|thumb|250px|Screenshot from the first version of Becoming Me]]
====Synopsis====
[[Liko]] holds her pendant before letting go, causing it to glow brightly as the camera zooms out. [[Roy]] holds one of the ancient adventurer's Poké Balls, gazing up at the clear sky surrounded by clouds. Liko and Roy lay down on the battlefield, exhausted as {{TP|Liko|Sprigatito}} and {{TP|Roy|Fuecoco}} come to their sides and they exchange a laugh. [[Mollie]] is in the nursery with {{TP|Mollie|Chansey}}, {{DL|Rising Volt Tacklers|Pawmi}}, {{DL|Rising Volt Tacklers|Shuckle}}, {{DL|Rising Volt Tacklers|Snorunt}}, and {{DL|Rising Volt Tacklers|Alolan Muk}}, turning around in her chair as Chansey carries a tray to the opposite end of the room. In the kitchen, [[Murdock]]'s {{TP|Murdock|Alcremie}} fills a bowl with cream as Murdock and {{TP|Murdock|Rockruff}} are ready to make something out of it. [[Friede]] enters the Captain's deck to check on [[Captain Pikachu]] and {{TP|Friede|Charizard}}. In one of her videos, [[Dot|Nidothing]] and {{TP|Dot|Quaxly}} dance and get up close to the camera. Charizard and Cap watch as [[Amethio]] orders {{TP|Amethio|Ceruledge}} to attack while Liko and Sprigatito clash with Roy and Fuecoco. Liko and Sprigatito are shown together outside the observation room, enjoying the breeze. The logo appears in front of all the [[Rising Volt Tacklers]] walking together ahead of the [[Brave Olivine]].

